(With this book ends a project that basically started with the Fall of) Tj T*
(the Berlin Wall in 1989. My hope is that this book contributes to the) Tj T*
(fall of some other walls, i.e. the intangible mental ones, consisting) Tj T*
(of perceptions and conventions - but equally confining.) Tj T*
