() Tj T*
(Since the problem is found to be equal across nations and across time,) Tj T*
(we may look for common factors. The basic factor that we can identify) Tj T*
(is the Trias Politica structure of Western democracies. The present) Tj T*
(checks and balances are imperfect. This structure appears to allow too) Tj T*
(much leeway for forces that are detrimental to the economic well-being) Tj T*
(of the population at large, their economic security and their) Tj T*
(possibilities for the pursuit of happiness. The structure of economic) Tj T*
(policy making allows politicians, bureaucrats and special interest) Tj T*
(groups too much room to distort the contribution of economic) Tj T*
(scientists.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The conceptual scheme of the Trias Politica was a useful ladder to) Tj T*
(climb out of the situation of feodality and absolute kings. But a) Tj T*
(ladder is not a goal in itself. Democracy is a living concept and can) Tj T*
(develop further. If we find that the Trias Politica fail with regards) Tj T*
(to our needs, then we should adapt it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
