(situation that the government announces a policy while the true) Tj T*
(scientific forecast shows that the policy is untenable and will be) Tj T*
(repealed later. Hence there is an internal source of conflict - the) Tj T*
(worst kind, not a dysfunctional person, but a logical knot.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
