(are helpful to us and expand our mental powers. We can retrieve the) Tj T*
(partial picture at other times and in different circumstances, imagine) Tj T*
(variations to it, extrapolate it, or just forget it. Often, great) Tj T*
(scientific achievements will be examples of one extraordinary) Tj T*
(individual?s ability to reduce a complex mass of information to a) Tj T*
(single pattern. Nor does this inclination to abbreviate stop at the) Tj T*
(door of the laboratory. Beyond the scientific realm we might understand) Tj T*
(our penchant for religious and mystical explanations of experience as) Tj T*
(another application of this faculty for editing reality down fo a few) Tj T*
(single principles which make it seem under control. All this gives rise) Tj T*
(to dichotomies. Our greatest scientific achievements spring from the) Tj T*
(most insightful and elegant reductions of the superficial complexities) Tj T*
(of Nature to reveal their underlying simplicities, while our greatest) Tj T*
(blunders often arise from the oversimplification of aspects of reality) Tj T*
(that subsequently prove to be far more complex than we realized.?) Tj T*
