(Our first proposition establishes conditions under which both) Tj T*
(unemployment and full employment are possible. This relates to the) Tj T*
(_partial _arguments of economists about the labour market. Our second) Tj T*
(proposition gives the integral argument, or _general _theory, how \(un-\)) Tj T*
(employment situations are managed. The employment regime can be chosen) Tj T*
