(\(1992\). It is from this experience that these two propositions have) Tj T*
(been selected as being of foremost importance. We want to focus on main) Tj T*
(mechanisms that block full employment and prosperous growth in modern) Tj T*
(welfare states. It is thought that the two propositions, in a sense) Tj T*
(simple but in another sense complex, help to clarify a fruitful) Tj T*
(direction for both analysis and policy improvement.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
