(the negative effects of the wedge occur primarily at the onset of) Tj T*
(economic growth, and are less noticeable when stagnation has already) Tj T*
(set in. This already has been indicated above, but the argument can be) Tj T*
(developed by giving formulas and plots. Especially, it are the plots) Tj T*
(that may help us to understand that the major distortionary effects) Tj T*
