() Tj T*
(\(e\)    There was a seminar by McCloskey on virtue ethics that was) Tj T*
(illuminating and that I can advise to who has a chance to attend. Smith) Tj T*
(\(1759, 1984\), ?The theory of moral sentiments?, featured strongly.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(f\)     A general point in ethical theory is that people aren?t really) Tj T*
(?souvereign consumers?. They grow from dependent children to mature) Tj T*
(adults to dependent seniors, so that there is always a degree of) Tj T*
(dependency. Political economy takes this into account. The standard) Tj T*
(economic approach that assumes souvereign consumers however can still) Tj T*
(be useful for analysis even while being limited in this respect.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(g\)    Another point concerns the distinction between ?rules? and) Tj T*
(?rhetorics?. In ethics, it does not suffice to have rules only, since) Tj T*
(these must be applied to practical situations ? where rhetorics apply.) Tj T*
(In law, there are not only laws but also courts. Current literature in) Tj T*
(economics tends to emphasize rules. If economics had courts too then) Tj T*
(there might be less imbalance. The suggestion that there be economic) Tj T*
(courts links with the idea of an Economic Supreme Court.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(h\)    There are some other advisable books that enrich our) Tj T*
(understanding of humanity, \(social\) behaviour, ethics and its) Tj T*
(biological roots, which form the input for and target of political) Tj T*
(economy. Tiger \(1992\), ?The pursuit of pleasure?, mollifies the) Tj T*
(economistic calculus of utility, which at the same time clarifies that) Tj T*
(it still can be useful to use small abstract \(simplistic\) models to) Tj T*
(develop arguments that can improve the lifes of many. Damasio \(2003\),) Tj T*
(?Looking for Spinoza?, delves into the brain to understand human) Tj T*
(emotion and feeling. Though many dimensions exist, there still is the) Tj T*
(pain and pleasure dichotomy that links to ethics. Damasio also notes) Tj T*
(that biological ?emotions? \(generally\) arise split-seconds before being) Tj T*
(reflected in ?feeling? in the mind. This phenomenon raises the question) Tj T*
