(small general equilibrium model, we showed that innovation and economic) Tj T*
(growth are an example of a free lunch for the whole economy. Our) Tj T*
(intention was to refute the attitude of ?there aint no such thing as a) Tj T*
(free lunch?. Hopefully, this refutation creates more room for) Tj T*
(discussion of proposals concerning the present immense inefficiency on) Tj T*
