(lunch.?; it says that there are limited resources, that to have more of) Tj T*
(one thing you must accept less of another, that there is no gain) Tj T*
(without pain. Depression economics, however, is the study of situations) Tj T*
(where there _is_ a free lunch, if we can only figure out how to get our) Tj T*
(hands on it, because there are unemployed resources that could be put) Tj T*
(to work. In 1930 John Maynard Keynes wrote that ?we have involved) Tj T*
