(points too. Interestingly, where these authors disagree, my own work) Tj T*
(offers new answers, on angles clearly not considered by them. My) Tj T*
(analysis solves conflicts, fills gaps, and complements on useful) Tj T*
(points. By relating my work to theirs I hope to enable these authors) Tj T*
(and their readers to plug into - what I consider - a new synthesis for) Tj T*
(\(a renewed\) mainstream economics.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Introduction) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Mainstream economics appears to accept high rates of \(equilibrium\)) Tj T*
(unemployment as the apparent characteristic of the modern economy. In) Tj T*
(this view, unemployment is not inefficient, but the unavoidable price) Tj T*
(to be paid for other desirables. Take for example the case that the) Tj T*
(United States has low welfare provisions, less unemployment but more) Tj T*
(poverty and many prisons, while the European Union has high welfare) Tj T*
(provisions, high unemployment, less poverty and far fewer prisons:) Tj T*
(these differences then are explained in terms of political choices for) Tj T*
(example about institutions, labour market flexibility and) Tj T*
(employability; and it is suggested that such choices are made at the) Tj T*
(efficiency frontier. Research economists however are more focussed on) Tj T*
(the question whether current policy really is optimal and whether) Tj T*
(current unemployment is really \(in-\) efficient. The search is for a) Tj T*
(Pareto improving solution such that some can advance - notably the) Tj T*
(unemployed and the poor \(underemployed\) - without costs to the others.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Specifically, Paul Krugman, Edmund Phelps, Paul Ormerod, Robert) Tj T*
(Heilbroner & William Milberg\) and myself have tried to supplement the) Tj T*
(mainstream approach. The first authors have received a lot of) Tj T*
(attention, but did not succeed in finding a Pareto improving solution) Tj T*
(to current unemployment. My analysis has received little attention,) Tj T*
(though I must confess that I did find such a solution.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
