(book contains a lot of hyperbole of the kind that ?things really are) Tj T*
(OK?. The authors of course are right that there has been hyperbole) Tj T*
(about American failure. Their suggestion that this sense of doom) Tj T*
(originates from the midlife crisis of the baby boom generation, may) Tj T*
(well be true too. Cox and Alm likely are right as well that emotions) Tj T*
