(45. After 35 years of mass unemployment:) Tj T*
(An advice to boycott Holland) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Summary) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Jan Tinbergen helped create the Dutch Central Planning Bureau \(CPB\)) Tj T*
(after 1945, and Dutch society has benefitted enormously up to this very) Tj T*
(day in 2004. The Dutch situation has also been an example to the world.) Tj T*
(But there is a down side when the CPB adopts a wrong theory and when) Tj T*
(policy becomes misguided. Economic theory is created by people, the) Tj T*
(behaviour of people can also be described by Public Choice theory, and) Tj T*
(good theory need not get properly adopted. Dutch society suffers huge) Tj T*
(problems, which problems do not exist just by themselves, but they can) Tj T*
(also be judged from the angle of the failure of co-ordination. It can) Tj T*
(be established as a fact that the directorate of the CPB has been) Tj T*
(censoring economic science for almost 15 years now, so that society is) Tj T*
(in a suboptimal state. The mechanisms in Dutch society apparently are) Tj T*
(too weak to solve this issue. The stress in Dutch society even causes) Tj T*
(the breakdown of the mechanisms that might work otherwise. With 9-11) Tj T*
(there is the new terrorism that increases the stress. That stress in) Tj T*
(Dutch society is highlighted by political landslides and political) Tj T*
(murder so unexpected of this country. The censored theory originally) Tj T*
(provided a solution to Stagflation, but it can also help to resolve the) Tj T*
(social and economic problems following 9-11. The censored theory would) Tj T*
(be relevant for other nations as well. For theoretical and practical) Tj T*
(reasons the censorship must be resolved at CPB itself. Given the weak) Tj T*
(mechanisms in Dutch society to protect the integrity of science in the) Tj T*
(preparation of policy, it becomes rational to advise an international) Tj T*
(boycott of Holland. Economic sticks and carrots are strong incentives) Tj T*
(to motivate people to stop and think. An international boycott of) Tj T*
(Holland would likely induce the Dutch to restore the integrity at CPB) Tj T*
(as intended by Tinbergen.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
