(Henk Don, who has a high personal and professional respect nationally) Tj T*
(and internationally, which I agree with except for the censorship. It) Tj T*
(must be noted that Henk was vice-director at the time when the original) Tj T*
(censorship took place, was not directly involved and does not know some) Tj T*
(details, but nevertheless firmly supports the censorship and abuse of) Tj T*
(science.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The key points of the censorship are as follows. The paper was blocked) Tj T*
(from internal discussion by the CPB directorate and eventually I was) Tj T*
(fired in 1991. The court observed an abuse of power but nevertheless) Tj T*
(allowed the dismissal. There is weak legal protection for Dutch public) Tj T*
(employees, while the court also did not properly distinguish between my) Tj T*
(position as an economic scientist and the other position of) Tj T*
(non-scientific public employees. Apart from the treatment of my person,) Tj T*
(the publication process itself was this: I intended the paper for) Tj T*
(publication as a CPB Research Memorandum, the series ?under the) Tj T*
(responsibility of the author?. The possibility of an internal) Tj T*
(discussion with interested colleagues seemed to me a necessary step) Tj T*
(before I could finalise the paper. The analysis is sound, but the) Tj T*
(colleagues can have questions and comments that contibute to enhanced) Tj T*
(clarity. This possibility however was blocked by the directorate. A) Tj T*
(committee on good scientific conduct, consisting of professor Köbben) Tj T*
(\(Leiden\) and professor Segers \(Tilburg\), observed that the directorate) Tj T*
(would have done better in permitting that internal discussion. My) Tj T*
(position is that I wait till that discussion is permitted indeed, so) Tj T*
(that I can finalise the analysis and let it be published as intended.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Some more details are in the appendices to this whole book: the) Tj T*
(autobiographical note and my presentation for the National Press in) Tj T*
(Washington 1993 with attached job resume of that time. Updates can be) Tj T*
(found on the web.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Many economists react that I could also publish the \(1990a\) paper \(or a) Tj T*
(revision\) in an international journal. This however is both beside the) Tj T*
(point, while it also meets with practical problems.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(· First, the point is that the CPB directorate censors science. When) Tj T*
(the problem is at CPB then it must be solved at CPB. Let me note that) Tj T*
(when I discussed the censorship with Jan Tinbergen, he said that the) Tj T*
(issue needed resolution ?but by a younger generation than me?. It) Tj T*
(actually is rather curious that one would want the journals to solve) Tj T*
(the issue while maintaining the censorship at CPB, and then, when the) Tj T*
(issue is resolved, ask CPB to apply it for the Central Economic Plan.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(· Secondly, there are various practical problems. The \(1990a\) paper is) Tj T*
(already on the web since 1995, and I do not see it used to solve) Tj T*
(unemployment. So availability is not sufficient, there must also be) Tj T*
(proper context and channelling. The paper has been written for a CPB) Tj T*
(Research Memorandum, it assumes a CPB context and it targets an enquiry) Tj T*
(by Dutch parliament. Before the web existed, I submitted the paper to) Tj T*
(two journals, one Dutch, one international, but it came back with) Tj T*
(useless comments. This is only a small sample, and the paper might be) Tj T*
