(envoys to Parliament to do something about this rather weird situation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Yes, I have really tried everything else possible. My efforts have been) Tj T*
(listed in Colignatus & Hulst \(2003\), but a selection for an) Tj T*
(international audience is:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(· Dutch government has an Office of Integrity, but this has been) Tj T*
(installed only recently \(suggesting that there were no solutions) Tj T*
(before?\), and they don?t take ?old cases? \(even though the directorate) Tj T*
(of the CPB still censors the analysis: I recently asked for some proper) Tj T*
(decisions, the court established that they should reply, and they) Tj T*
(replied as a censor does\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(· The Academy of Science \(KNAW\) sees no task to cover the official) Tj T*
(governmental research institutes that claim a scientific status, such) Tj T*
(as CPB, SCP, RIVM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(· I?ve also asked my last employer, the Department of Public Health at) Tj T*
(Erasmus MC, whether they would support a suggestion to KNAW to) Tj T*
(investigate the CPB case because of its importance for the integrity of) Tj T*
(science. Professor Richard Gill of Utrecht University already supported) Tj T*
(that suggestion. If Erasmus MC thinks that I have some professional) Tj T*
(standing, as they renewed my contract in October 2003, perhaps they) Tj T*
(also value my judgement on this issue on the integrity of science. The) Tj T*
(censorship by the directorate of the CPB also has consequences for) Tj T*
(Public Health, not only in Holland, but via economic theory in all) Tj T*
(countries. To my regret, this discussion appeared difficult to resolve.) Tj T*
(For a longer discussion, see my website on the topic of public health.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(· I?ve written a string of newspaper articles in the beginning of the) Tj T*
(1990s, but to no avail. This is about the same period when Fortuyn was) Tj T*
(put down by Kok and Melkert as well. Nowadays newspapers fundamentally) Tj T*
(neglect me, seem to regard me as some idiot who should stay in his) Tj T*
(cage. My recent book with Hans Hulst has had a decent and highly) Tj T*
(positive review in the magazine for Dutch teachers in economics, and) Tj T*
(similarly in a newsletter for socially involved workers in the) Tj T*
(Churches, but got a short negative put down in a social science) Tj T*
(journal, and has otherwise been neglected.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The censorship of science now takes almost 15 years. This year I turn) Tj T*
(50, and that is a good moment to take stock. Institutions are stronger) Tj T*
(than people, what resources remain? I see no other prospects. So, alas,) Tj T*
(I must advise you to boycott Holland.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
