(46. Final conclusion) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Considering all these arguments, I think that it is best that) Tj T*
(economists advise their parliaments to investigate these matters. The) Tj T*
(television cameras should not focus on the debate between the parties,) Tj T*
(for a while, but on the didactic discourse between politicians and) Tj T*
(scientists.) Tj T*
