(?unintended consequences? against social change, and in fact makes fun) Tj T*
(of it:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(?The idea that unintended consequences of human action are responsible) Tj T*
(for many of the big changes in the world is not hard to appreciate.) Tj T*
(Things often do not go as we plan. Sometimes we have excellent reason) Tj T*
(to be grateful for this, whether we consider the discovery of) Tj T*
(penicillin from a leftover dish not intended for that purpose, or the) Tj T*
