() Tj T*
(John D. Barrow \(1998\) ?Impossibility? gives a nice introduction into) Tj T*
(some of the topics that we encounter when developing the Definition &) Tj T*
(Reality methodology. I have taken a useful quote from one of his pages) Tj T*
(to emphasise a main point. A point of consideration however is that) Tj T*
(Barrow only provides an introduction and a starting point, and there is) Tj T*
(need for more discussion and refinement of the argument. Some points of) Tj T*
(warning are:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.       Barrow uncritically adopts Arrow?s explanation for his) Tj T*
(impossibility theorem - and we have shown that this explanation is) Tj T*
(erroneous.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
