(the Treasury reflects the view of the Treasury secretary. In giving) Tj T*
(direct advice to the president, I always spoke for myself rather than) Tj T*
(on behalf of the Council.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The CEA has a small but high quality professional staff of about twenty) Tj T*
(economists and four economist statisticians. The statisticians are) Tj T*
(permanent civil servants who understand the construction of official) Tj T*
(economic statistics and do their best to save the economists from) Tj T*
(erroneous use of these data. Because the senior staff economists come) Tj T*
(fro universities for a one- or two-year period, they keep the CEA up to) Tj T*
(date on the best academic thinking on a wide range of subjects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Although the CEA is physically as well as operationally part of the) Tj T*
(White House complex \(CEA offices are in the Old Executive Office) Tj T*
(Building adjacent to the White House and within the same security) Tj T*
(cordon\), the economic staff functions in a completely professional and) Tj T*
(nonpartisan way. My very able and distinguished staff included Larry) Tj T*
(Summers, who was prominent as chief economic adviser to presidential) Tj T*
(candidate Michael Dukakis.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The tradition of professionalist is so strong that even in a) Tj T*
(presidential election year the CEA chairman appoints members of the) Tj T*
(staff for the coming academic year with the clear understanding that) Tj T*
(they will continue to serve even if the party in power loses the) Tj T*
(presidential election. I might just add in this context that, unlike) Tj T*
(the practice in some countries, the members of the CEA and their staff) Tj T*
(work full-time at their CEA responsibilities. Indeed, in December and) Tj T*
(January of each year, the pressure of working simultaneously on the) Tj T*
(Economic Report of the President, the budget, and the issues to be) Tj T*
(presented in the president?s state of the union message seemed like) Tj T*
(much more than a full-time job.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The CEA was created by the Employment Act of 1946 with a Keynesian) Tj T*
(heritage and an expectation that it would give advice about the use of) Tj T*
(fiscal policy to achieve and maintain full employment. Needless to say,) Tj T*
(there has been a profound change in the economics profession?s thinking) Tj T*
(about macroeconomic policy in the past forty years.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Commenting on this) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Above description of the US CEA shows that it is very close to the) Tj T*
(Executive. There is ?professionalism? - and we may willingly interprete) Tj T*
(that to mean that one keeps a distance to political scheming and the) Tj T*
(illusions of the day - but still, this is not auditing, this is not) Tj T*
(verification for verification?s sake, this is not vetoing David) Tj T*
(Stockman, this is not sticking to one?s own perception of what the) Tj T*
(right model is regardless of what the President likes to think. If) Tj T*
(there would be an Economic Supreme Court, then, indeed, the President) Tj T*
(would still have need for advice as currently provided by the CEA. One) Tj T*
(would imagine that CEA staff members would frequent the Court?s) Tj T*
(offices, and such. But the constitutional powers would be) Tj T*
(institutionally separated.) Tj T*
ET
