(We can see that the CEA is so understaffed and so preoccupied with its) Tj T*
(duties of ?running about for the President?, that it failed to pick up) Tj T*
(an important analysis. In April 1993, I sent a major piece of my work) Tj T*
(to the CEA. And got no reply.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In August 1993, I actually visited the US Treasury, but with little) Tj T*
(success. See the appendix on presenting the analysis to the US National) Tj T*
(Press below, and the autobiographical appendix as well.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
