(increase in the Earned Income Tax Credit \(EITC\) - see next appendix. I) Tj T*
(don?t think that my paper and visit contributed to that. If it has,) Tj T*
(they should have replied - and could have gone much further. \(But I do) Tj T*
(think that the Clinton EITC measure helped, as one factor, to create) Tj T*
(the subsequent the long boom in the US economy. There was more) Tj T*
(competition on the labour market, and this helped to reduce wage) Tj T*
(growth.\)) Tj T*
