(Presentation for the National Press in Washington 1993) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The following is a bit of an ambarrasment, but modern courage is not) Tj T*
(fighting wild animals but facing such possible views in public opinion.) Tj T*
(Anyway, in 1993 my Class of ?73 \(of Burbank Highschool, California\)) Tj T*
(had, guess what, a 20 year reunion. I took the opportunity to visit) Tj T*
(Washington, visit the US Treasury, and also present my analysis at the) Tj T*
(National Press Building. When I arrived there on August 17, it appeared) Tj T*
(that almost everyone had taken their holiday, following President) Tj T*
(Clinton to Martha?s Vineyard. My appointment with the Treasury lasted) Tj T*
(only some 20 minutes, and my host was too much involved in the Health) Tj T*
(Plan and showed no interest in my analysis. The journalists) Tj T*
(subsequently must have been at the beach - or in Europe - since nobody) Tj T*
(showed up. Perhaps my press release was uninviting too - judge for) Tj T*
(yourself, below. I took care that it was distributed to all agencies -) Tj T*
(which was another bill to pay. The idea remains: people have had the) Tj T*
(opportunity. Note 1: Had I still been at the CPB, then my possibility) Tj T*
(frontier with US officials of course had been larger. Note 2: My) Tj T*
(foreign exchange year at Burbank High and participation in the US) Tj T*
(National Forensics League apparently rubbed off, and I got some editing) Tj T*
(help from an American friend: so that my presentation was All American.) Tj T*
