(for my scientific work for better distinction from political or) Tj T*
(commercial work. I remain of course a single individual but the papers) Tj T*
(and books can be usefully labelled differently. In some archives you) Tj T*
(will have to keep searching on the name ?Cool?.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(2\)    Unfortunately, I have not been able yet to extend the discussion) Tj T*
