(new job in a new field that required much new study.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(3\)    The book now uses euro?s. I didn?t use the latest data but use) Tj T*
(those of Colignatus & Hulst \(2003\) for consistency. The Enlargement of) Tj T*
(the EU from 15 to 25 member states on May 1 2004 caused some changes in) Tj T*
(the data and text however. A discussion with Henk Folmer \(Wageningen) Tj T*
(University\) caused an update on OECD data and papers, clarification of) Tj T*
(some points in the argument, and the longer Abstract below.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(4\)    Colignatus \(2001\) ?Voting theory for democracy? is my) Tj T*
(implementation of the theory on social choice within _Mathematica_. An) Tj T*
(earlier suggestion of \(1990c\) for an algorithm was developed in more) Tj T*
(detail, which caused me to find a name for it: this became the ?Borda) Tj T*
(fixed point? approach. Further reflection caused the paper Colignatus) Tj T*
(\(2002\) ?Without time no morality? that now has been adapted to a new) Tj T*
(chapter in this edition. The total enriches the analysis on Arrow?s) Tj T*
(Theorem with a practical social choice algorithm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(5\)    The chapter with notes on ethics has been added.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(6\)    The chapters on the reduced form have been re-united into Book) Tj T*
(IX again. In the earlier paper Colignatus \(1992b, 1995a\) they already) Tj T*
(formed a unity, but in the first edition of this book they got) Tj T*
(separated for a reason that appeared unconvincing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(7\)    Since Coligatus \(1990\) had in its title ?After 20 years of mass) Tj T*
(unemployment?, I could write \(2004\) ?After 35 years of mass) Tj T*
