(There is a peculiar streak in Dutch society that is wildly at odds with) Tj T*
(its reputation for tolerance. Namely, the Dutch can react strongly to) Tj T*
(someone who threathens their view of the world. A similar phenomenon) Tj T*
(can be observed in other cultures too, but it is strong in Holland. My) Tj T*
(inclination is to link this phenomenon to the observation in) Tj T*
(Cavalli-Sforza \(2000:184\) of different mentalities in France: ?Hervé Le) Tj T*
