(well-advised to install an Economic Supreme Court. This volume includes) Tj T*
(a draft constitutional amendment that shows that such a measure can) Tj T*
(indeed enhance democracy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The fundamental structure for current policy making in a democracy is) Tj T*
(Montesquieu?s model of the separation of powers, i.e. the Legislative,) Tj T*
(Executive and Judicial branches that form the ?Trias Politica?. It) Tj T*
(appears that this structure still allows room for economic policy) Tj T*
(making that is detrimental to the life and liberty of the citizens of) Tj T*
(the state. The key issue appears to be that there is no independent) Tj T*
(protection of the quality of information. With all the social, economic) Tj T*
(and political interests involved, the current process of economic) Tj T*
(policy making allows the current constitutional powers too much room) Tj T*
(for distortion of the information. Economic theory then suggests the) Tj T*
(creation of an Economic Supreme Court as a separate constitutional) Tj T*
(power with the task of the scientific management of information. The) Tj T*
(legislative and executive branches would still decide on policy targets) Tj T*
(and policy execution, but they would lose the power to interfere with) Tj T*
(the scientific handling of information. This argument can be developed) Tj T*
(purely theoretically. The economic experience of the last century shows) Tj T*
(that the argument is also practically relevant.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Political Economy as a science has the general objective of explaining) Tj T*
(and advising the management of the state. Two hallmark reference points) Tj T*
(exist in the _General Theory _by Keynes \(1936\) and the analysis by) Tj T*
(Tinbergen \(1956\) on the principles and design of economic policy) Tj T*
(making. These studies show that the state can be subject to long) Tj T*
(periods of economic recession and even depression if not properly) Tj T*
(managed. Since the end of World War II, application of these ideas has) Tj T*
(allowed spectacular economic growth while depression has been prevented) Tj T*
(indeed. However, the economic record especially since the 1970s is) Tj T*
(mixed, with issues like stagflation, problems with the welfare state) Tj T*
(and continued poverty and also with the issue of sustainable) Tj T*
(development and protection of the environment. It can be shown beyond) Tj T*
(reasonable doubt that economic policy has been detrimental to the life) Tj T*
(and liberty of many of its citizens while this came about by) Tj T*
(mismanagement of the available information.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(An element of self-reference arises when economic policy uses economic) Tj T*
(theory itself, so that theory should include theory. Increasingly over) Tj T*
(the years, economic theory has gotten a role in the management of the) Tj T*
(state, and developments in the real economy cannot be properly) Tj T*
(understood without reference to the economic ideas adopted for national) Tj T*
(policy. Since economic theories give conflicting advice, part of the) Tj T*
(management problem of the state is the selection of the appropriate) Tj T*
(theory, and this selection is more and more the key management problem.) Tj T*
(At the next higher level of abstraction, the process of selection) Tj T*
(becomes the focus of attention. The problem then becomes what that) Tj T*
(process is, what criteria of transparancy and fairness it satisfies,) Tj T*
(and how the process itself affects the economy. The current structure) Tj T*
(gives too much room for political elites and bureaucrats to neglect the) Tj T*
(basic rights of the population at large. The criterion to judge an) Tj T*
ET
