([21] Kennedy \(1999:241\) describes the threat of Huey Long: ?Roosevelt) Tj T*
(shared that assesment. ?Long plans to be a candidate of the Hitler type) Tj T*
(for the presidency in 1936,? he told William E. Dodd, his ambassador to) Tj T*
(Germany. ?He thinks he will have a hundred votes in the Democratic) Tj T*
(party and put in a reactionary Republican. That would bring the country) Tj T*
(to such a state by 1940 that Long thinks he would be made dictator.) Tj T*
(There are in fact some Southerners looking that way, and some) Tj T*
(Progressives are drifting that way? Thus it is an ominous situation.?) Tj T*
([note] ? Also, the US already had a disputable policy with regards to) Tj T*
(its Black population, and no doubt they could be made scapegoats like) Tj T*
(the Jews in Europe.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([22] Hayek discussed ?knowledge? and ?constitutional reform?, so that) Tj T*
(the current line of thought is not alien to economics - though see the) Tj T*
(appendix on Hayek.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([23] There exists still one matter to settle though. Krugman suggests) Tj T*
(that Supply-siders were no serious economists. Similarly, Mankiw) Tj T*
(\(1998:29\) calls it ?fad economics?. But after they got their respective) Tj T*
(Nobel Prizes, both Lucas and Mundell told the press that they were such) Tj T*
(Supply-siders.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([24] The two major recent revisions in the US, the chained price index) Tj T*
(and the redefinition of software as investment \(and thus growth\), are) Tj T*
(just examples.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([25] If the Court would be scientific but would be only an island in an) Tj T*
(ocean of neglect, the Court would already be an improvement over the) Tj T*
(current situation - but less than optimally so. A wise parliament also) Tj T*
(provides for funds for independent research bodies with related) Tj T*
(objectives, that then will provide a critical working environment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([26] The term ?existing theory? will be used in this volume for the) Tj T*
(tradition of research and results indicated by these references.  In) Tj T*
(the light of the abundance of schools and attitudes it is a bit) Tj T*
(difficult of course to apply that term. However, those who have studied) Tj T*
(Krugman?s books and above references, should be senstive to this) Tj T*
(suggestion. As a next step, I will present a novel analysis below, that) Tj T*
( leaves much of existing economic theory intact, and only supplements) Tj T*
(it with some ?missing links?. With this supplement it becomes even) Tj T*
(easier to recognise the ?existing economics?.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([27] Note that this book quotes Keynes a lot, and in particular the 60) Tj T*
(year old _General Theory_, and only refers to modern authors. Some) Tj T*
(readers might find this out of balance. However, in the light of the) Tj T*
(main argument, about the Trias Politica and the Economic Supreme Court,) Tj T*
(I found it rather natural to proceed like this. I think that it) Tj T*
(emphasises the enduring quality of economics per se. That, admittedly,) Tj T*
(is a matter of taste.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
