([128] Galbraith does not refer to Bruno & Sachs \(1985\), but it is) Tj T*
(useful to note that this B&S analysis would be a major part for the) Tj T*
(explanations of the ordeal in the 1970s - which analysis apparently was) Tj T*
(insufficiently understood by Carter and Volcker. Also, a reference for) Tj T*
