([132] Saramago?s new book speaks about a town where 83% of the) Tj T*
(population decides, silently and without any voiced protests, to vote a) Tj T*
(blank. The number 83% is a masterly stroke since it sounds much more) Tj T*
(realistic than 80% or 75% or 51%. But, is there any link with Fortuyn?s) Tj T*
(17% result or is it just coincidence ?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
